{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"crop_wheat","model_identifier":"crop_wheat","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# crop_wheat\n\nWheat row: green stalks turning golden, ripe at about 90 cm (32 u) with golden ears.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -8..8, y 0..3, z -6..6 units (0.45 x 0.09 x 0.34 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 64 x 64, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 70.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 16 x 3 x 12 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `seeded` (visible by default): dark tilled ridge with seed holes\n- `sprout`: first green shoots\n- `growing`: half-grown green plants\n- `ripe`: tall golden stalks with ears\n- `harvested`: after harvest\n\n## Notes\n\n- One row segment, 1 column (16 u) long along X, centred on the origin; tile rows side by side every 16 u in Z for a field.\n"},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"soil_seeded","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8.0,0.0,-6.0],"to":[8.0,1.0,6.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[10.0,55.0,26.0,56.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[26.0,55.0,38.0,56.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[10.0,55.0,26.0,56.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[26.0,55.0,38.0,56.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[20.0,29.0,36.0,41.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[20.0,29.0,36.0,41.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"4b948af8-3862-56be-9d3b-30dd3ac33217"},{"name":"ridge_seeded","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[